# Static members across SEPARATE packages. `@test/mathx` exports classes with
# static methods and static readonly fields; the root app calls/reads them.
# `Pure` is used ONLY through statics — never constructed, never extended —
# pinning that static-only usage still forces imported-class reconstruction.
# `LocalCalc` subclasses the imported `Calc` and resolves inherited statics.
# name          dir    deps          root
@test/mathx     mathx  -
main            app    @test/mathx   root
